flowchart LR
    push[Push or pull request] -.-> t1[Backend tests]
    push -.-> t2[Frontend type check and tests]
    push -.-> t3[Showcase validation scripts]
    t1 -.-> gate{All green?}
    t2 -.-> gate
    t3 -.-> gate
    gate -.->|yes| db[Migration check against a disposable PostgreSQL]
    db -.-> deploy[Deploy frontend and backend]
    gate -.->|no| stop[Block merge]
    note[Proposed only: no CI is configured today]
